        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 30 Inch Offset Teak Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 30 Inch Teak Door Pull from First Impressions' <a href=\"/collections/wood-door-pulls\"><b>Wood Door Pull</b></a>  collection. It is 30 Inches long with a 24 inch center to center. This Offset Teak Door Handle has a 1 inch dimeter.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTeak is used for these door handles because of its hard, strong, and durable characteristics. It is also resistant to insects and warping, even when exposed directly to harsh weather, making it the ideal choice for exterior doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions PR-CFRBW/30-TEAK-2 Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Teak</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Length Center or Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket: Offset</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This Teak wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 door pulls)</i>\r\n</p>",
